read a5206
do append a5206 line="# a6010 board roles: begin (board-lab/apply.py replaces this block)\n# a6010: the board as an inbox (direction-board-inbox). Round 2: LAMPLIT's rule (a6057), colour says whose move it is:\n# warm (amber) only on what waits on Alex, jeff (lilac) on a resident's move, accent (mint) only on an agent acting this\n# moment; everything else soft grey on the glass, and controls white. Lists, not tiles; nothing moves.\nrole nb : between gap x2\nrole nbbands : between gap x3\nrole nbband : between gap /2\nrole nbhead : between gap, pad bottom gap /2, pad left gap /2\nrole nbname : text down 2 medium tracked, soft\nrole nbname.need : text down 2 medium tracked, warm\nrole nbname.link : text down 2 medium, ink\nrole nbcount : text down 2 medium, soft\nrole nbcount.need : text down 2 medium, night, on warm, corner gap x2, pad left gap /1.5, pad right gap /1.5\nrole nbquiet : text down 2, soft\nrole nblive : text down 2, accent\nrole nbcards : between gap /2\nrole nblater : between gap /2, space above gap /2\nrole nbjeff : between gap /4, space above gap /2\nrole nbfold : text down 2 medium tracked, soft, pad gap /4\nrole nbfold.jeff : text down 2 medium tracked, jeff, pad gap /4\nrole nbchev : text down 2, faint\n# leaves/away (a6010, round 3): a needs-you card is not drawn while a press on its own answer waits for the desk\nrole nbneed : on raised, rail warm, corner gap, pad gap /1.5, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap, leaves\nrole nbneed.fail : on raised, rail warm, corner gap, pad gap /1.5, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap, leaves\nrole nbline : between gap, align center\nrole nbbody : between gap, pad top gap /2, pad bottom gap /2\nrole nbtop : between gap\nrole nbkind : text down 2, soft\nrole nbkind.review : text down 2 medium tracked, warm\nrole nbkind.design : text down 2 medium tracked, warm\nrole nbkind.fail : text down 2 medium tracked, warm\nrole nbwhen : text down 2, soft\nrole nbtitle : text medium, ink\nrole nbgist : text down, soft\nrole nbacts : between gap\nrole nbgo : text down 2 medium, night, on ink, corner gap x2, pad gap /4, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap x1.5, away\nrole nbbtn : text down 2, ink, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap /4, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap x1.5\nrole nbaway : text down 2, ink, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap /4, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap x1.5, away\nrole nbinput : text down, ink, on wash, corner gap, pad gap\nrole nbrows : between gap /4\nrole nbrow : corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole nbrow.live : corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole nbrowtitle : text down, ink\nrole nbstage : text down 2, soft\nrole nbstage.live : text down 2 medium, accent\nrole nbstage.jeff : text down 2 medium, jeff\nrole nbstage.queued : text down 2, soft\nrole nbstage.working : text down 2, soft\nrole nbstage.asks : text down 2 medium, jeff\nrole nbstage.ready : text down 2, soft\nrole nbstage.landing : text down 2, soft\nrole nbnow : text down 2, accent\nrole nbnote : between gap /4, pad left gap, border left rim\nrole nbnoteby : text down 2 medium, soft\nrole nbnotetext : text down, ink\nrole nbdone : between gap, pad gap /4, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole nbdonetitle : text down, soft\n# home-board-small, the one line: what needs Alex in amber, what waits on JEFF in lilac, the rest grey\nrole nbsmall : between gap\nrole nbsmall.need : text down medium, warm\nrole nbsmall.jeff : text down, jeff\n# the track of steps, and direction-board-focus (round 1, kept for the record)\nrole nbfocus : on raised, rail warm, corner gap x1.5, pad gap x2, pad left gap x2.5, between gap\nrole nbtitle.big : text up 2 medium, ink\nrole nbwho : text down 2, soft\nrole nbsteps : between gap /2\nrole nbstep : text down 2, faint\nrole nbstep.done : text down 2, soft\nrole nbstep.on : text down 2 medium, night, on ink, corner gap x2, pad left gap /1.5, pad right gap /1.5\nrole nbstep.jeff : text down 2 medium, night, on jeff, corner gap x2, pad left gap /1.5, pad right gap /1.5\nrole nbstep.ask : text down 2 medium, night, on jeff, corner gap x2, pad left gap /1.5, pad right gap /1.5\n# a6010 board roles: end"
read a5548
do rewrite a5548 text="# home-board: the board, one panel of the home base (a5674). The HUD sprint's lane 1, round 3 (a6010): an inbox. NEEDS\n# YOU (what waits on Alex: things to look at, designs waiting on his word, his own stuck commissions; it answers what\n# waiting-on-me did), IN MOTION, LANDED, one line per card. A line says what it is (brief= when the card has one, else\n# its title), how far along (a word at the right edge, and since when) and, on a line that needs Alex, its answer: one\n# press, never typing (Looks good, Send back, Later; Build it on a design; Try again). Colour says whose move it is\n# (LAMPLIT, lane 3): amber Alex's, lilac a resident's (what waits on JEFF folds into one line), mint an agent at work\n# this moment; the rest grey, buttons white. A press anywhere else on a line opens it in place at once (the viewer's own\n# fold): its track, who has it (names, never ids), its worker's latest word, Open in the middle, where its talk is\n# (one box for words, the middle's; agreed with lane 3 in a6049). Roles: the nb* block in home-style.\nboard : column\n  role nb\n  views : column\n    of prop:role=home-view,prop:actor=\$me as hv\n    each bands\n  lost : text \"No viewer note for you here (role=home-view, actor=you): Open has nowhere to show a card.\"\n    role hint\n    only when count(prop:role=home-view,prop:actor=\$me) = 0\nbands : column\n  role nbbands\n  let nneed = count(tag:ready-for-review,-prop:review=later) + count(prop:design=waiting,-prop:review=later) + count(prop:commission=failed,prop:asked_by=alex,-prop:review=later)\n  let nlater = count(tag:ready-for-review,prop:review=later) + count(prop:design=waiting,prop:review=later) + count(prop:commission=failed,prop:asked_by=alex,prop:review=later)\n  let nmove = count(prop:commission=asked) + count(prop:commission=working) + count(prop:commission=ready) + count(prop:commission=landing)\n  let njeff = count(prop:commission=waiting) + count(prop:commission=failed,prop:asked_by!=alex)\n  let nlanded = count(prop:commission=landed)\n  let busy = count(house doing=working)\n  need : column\n    role nbband\n    head : row\n      role nbhead\n      name : text \"NEEDS YOU\"\n        role nbname.need\n      n : text \"\$(nneed)\"\n        role nbcount.need\n        only when nneed > 0\n      gap : text \"\"\n        share 1\n      none : text \"nothing waits on you\"\n        role nbquiet\n        only when nneed = 0\n    reviews : column\n      role nbcards\n      of tag:ready-for-review,-prop:review=later as c\n      each review\n    designs : column\n      role nbcards\n      of prop:design=waiting,-prop:review=later as c\n      each design\n    failed : column\n      role nbcards\n      of prop:commission=failed,prop:asked_by=alex,-prop:review=later as c\n      each failure\n    later : column\n      role nblater\n      only when nlater > 0\n      fold \"Later · \$(nlater)\" handle nbfold\n      a : column\n        role nbcards\n        of tag:ready-for-review,prop:review=later as c\n        each review\n      b : column\n        role nbcards\n        of prop:design=waiting,prop:review=later as c\n        each design\n      f : column\n        role nbcards\n        of prop:commission=failed,prop:asked_by=alex,prop:review=later as c\n        each failure\n  move : column\n    role nbband\n    head : row\n      role nbhead\n      name : text \"IN MOTION\"\n        role nbname\n      n : text \"\$(nmove)\"\n        role nbcount\n      gap : text \"\"\n        share 1\n      live : text \"\$(busy) at work now\"\n        role nblive\n        only when busy > 0\n    landing : column\n      role nbrows\n      of prop:commission=landing as c\n      each moving\n    ready : column\n      role nbrows\n      of prop:commission=ready as c\n      each moving\n    working : column\n      role nbrows\n      of prop:commission=working as c\n      each moving\n    queued : column\n      role nbrows\n      of prop:commission=asked as c\n      each moving\n    jeff : column\n      role nbjeff\n      only when njeff > 0\n      fold \"WAITING ON JEFF · \$(njeff)\" handle nbfold.jeff\n      asking : column\n        role nbrows\n        of prop:commission=waiting as c\n        each moving\n      stuck : column\n        role nbrows\n        of prop:commission=failed,prop:asked_by!=alex as c\n        each moving\n  landed : column\n    role nbband\n    fold \"LANDED · \$(nlanded)\" handle nbfold\n    rows : column\n      role nbrows\n      of prop:commission=landed as c\n      each done\n# a thing waiting on Alex's look: a note, a demo, a report (tagged ready-for-review)\nreview : column\n  role nbneed\n  fold inline group open handle nbchev\n  line : row\n    peek\n    role nbline\n    what : text \"\$((\$c.brief or \$c.title))\"\n      role nbtitle\n      clamp 1\n      share 1\n    ok : text \"Looks good\"\n      role nbgo\n      on click do tag \$c remove=ready-for-review; do comment \$c line=\"@jeff: looks good (from the board)\"\n    no : text \"Send back\"\n      role nbaway\n      on click do tag \$c remove=ready-for-review; do comment \$c line=\"@jeff: not yet: send this back (from the board)\"\n    later : text \"Later\"\n      role nbaway\n      only when (\$c.review or \"\") != \"later\"\n      on click do prop \$c review=later\n    back : text \"Now\"\n      role nbaway\n      only when \$c.review = \"later\"\n      on click do prop \$c remove=review\n  body : column\n    role nbbody\n    facts : row\n      role nbtop\n      kind : text \"to look at\"\n        role nbwhen\n      demo : text \"· a demo inside\"\n        role nbwhen\n        only when (\$c.demo or \"\") != \"\"\n      when : text \"· waiting since \$(day-or-time(\$changed.tags, \$today))\"\n        role nbwhen\n        only when (\$changed.tags or \"\") != \"\"\n    gist : text \"\$c.text\"\n      role nbgist\n      clamp 4\n      only when (\$c.text or \"\") != \"\"\n    acts : row\n      role nbacts\n      open : text \"Open in the middle\"\n        role nbbtn\n        on click do read \$hv; do prop \$hv viewing=\$c back=\"\$hv.viewing\" find=\"\"\n# a design waiting on Alex's word: Build it is his word in one press (design=answered verdict=build, and a line in its\n# own talk, which reaches its author); Later puts it off; Read it opens it in the middle\ndesign : column\n  role nbneed\n  fold inline group open handle nbchev\n  line : row\n    peek\n    role nbline\n    what : text \"\$((\$c.brief or \$c.title))\"\n      role nbtitle\n      clamp 1\n      share 1\n    build : text \"Build it\"\n      role nbgo\n      on click when \$c.design = \"waiting\" and (\$c.talk or \"\") != \"\" do prop \$c design=answered verdict=build; do append \$c.talk line=\"Build it. (from the board)\"\n      on click when \$c.design = \"waiting\" and (\$c.talk or \"\") = \"\" do prop \$c design=answered verdict=build; do comment \$c line=\"@jeff: build it (from the board)\"\n    later : text \"Later\"\n      role nbaway\n      only when (\$c.review or \"\") != \"later\"\n      on click do prop \$c review=later\n    back : text \"Now\"\n      role nbaway\n      only when \$c.review = \"later\"\n      on click do prop \$c remove=review\n  body : column\n    role nbbody\n    by : text \"a design by \$((\$c.by or \"someone\")), waiting on your word\"\n      role nbwhen\n    acts : row\n      role nbacts\n      read : text \"Read it in the middle\"\n        role nbbtn\n        on click do read \$hv; do prop \$hv viewing=\$c back=\"\$hv.viewing\" find=\"\"\n# a commission Alex asked for that did not land and its worker could not mend: Try again starts its worker once more\nfailure : column\n  role nbneed\n  fold inline group open handle nbchev\n  line : row\n    peek\n    role nbline\n    what : text \"\$((\$c.brief or \$c.title))\"\n      role nbtitle\n      clamp 1\n      share 1\n    again : text \"Try again\"\n      role nbgo\n      on click when \$c.commission = \"failed\" do prop \$c commission=asked\n    later : text \"Later\"\n      role nbaway\n      only when (\$c.review or \"\") != \"later\"\n      on click do prop \$c review=later\n  body : column\n    role nbbody\n    who : text \"did not land; its worker could not mend it\"\n      role nbwhen\n    last : column\n      of comments:\$c.item as m\n      each note\n    acts : row\n      role nbacts\n      open : text \"Open in the middle\"\n        role nbbtn\n        on click do read \$hv; do prop \$hv viewing=\$c back=\"\$hv.viewing\" find=\"\"\n# one commission on its way: what, then at the right edge how far and since when; pressed, who has it and their word\nmoving : column\n  role nbrow\n  fold inline group open handle nbchev\n  line : row\n    peek\n    role nbline\n    what : text \"\$((\$c.brief or \$c.title))\"\n      role nbrowtitle\n      clamp 1\n      share 1\n    queued : text \"queued\"\n      role nbstage\n      only when \$c.commission = \"asked\"\n    live : text \"working\"\n      role nbstage.live\n      only when \$c.commission = \"working\" and count(house doing=working resident=\$c.worker) > 0\n    idle : text \"working\"\n      role nbstage\n      only when \$c.commission = \"working\" and count(house doing=working resident=\$c.worker) = 0\n    asks : text \"asks JEFF\"\n      role nbstage.jeff\n      only when \$c.commission = \"waiting\"\n    stuck : text \"stuck\"\n      role nbstage.jeff\n      only when \$c.commission = \"failed\"\n    ready : text \"ready to land\"\n      role nbstage\n      only when \$c.commission = \"ready\"\n    landing : text \"landing\"\n      role nbstage\n      only when \$c.commission = \"landing\"\n    since : text \"\$(day-or-time(\$changed.commission, \$today))\"\n      role nbwhen\n      only when (\$changed.commission or \"\") != \"\"\n  body : column\n    role nbbody\n    steps : row\n      role nbsteps\n      q : text \"queued\"\n        role nbstep\n        role nbstep.done when \$c.commission != \"asked\"\n        role nbstep.on when \$c.commission = \"asked\"\n      w : text \"working\"\n        role nbstep\n        role nbstep.done when \$c.commission = \"ready\" or \$c.commission = \"landing\"\n        role nbstep.on when \$c.commission = \"working\"\n        role nbstep.jeff when \$c.commission = \"waiting\" or \$c.commission = \"failed\"\n      r : text \"ready\"\n        role nbstep\n        role nbstep.done when \$c.commission = \"landing\"\n        role nbstep.on when \$c.commission = \"ready\"\n      l : text \"landing\"\n        role nbstep\n        role nbstep.on when \$c.commission = \"landing\"\n      d : text \"landed\"\n        role nbstep\n    who : row\n      role nbtop\n      codex : text \"a Codex builder\"\n        role nbname.link\n        only when \$c.worker_provider = \"codex\"\n        on click do read \$hv; do prop \$hv viewing=\$c back=\"\$hv.viewing\" find=\"\"\n      claude : text \"a Claude builder\"\n        role nbname.link\n        only when (\$c.worker_provider or \"\") != \"codex\" and (\$c.worker or \"\") != \"\"\n        on click do read \$hv; do prop \$hv viewing=\$c back=\"\$hv.viewing\" find=\"\"\n      owner : text \"\$c.owner\"\n        role nbname.link\n        only when (\$c.worker or \"\") = \"\" and (\$c.owner or \"\") != \"\"\n        on click do read \$hv; do prop \$hv viewing=\$c back=\"\$hv.viewing\" find=\"\"\n      now : text \"at work this moment\"\n        role nbnow\n        only when count(house doing=working resident=\$c.worker) > 0\n      jeff : text \"· asked by JEFF\"\n        role nbwhen\n        only when \$c.asked_by = \"jeff\"\n      for : text \"· asked by \$((\$c.asked_by or \"nobody\"))\"\n        role nbwhen\n        only when \$c.asked_by != \"jeff\"\n    last : column\n      of comments:\$c.item as m\n      each note\n    acts : row\n      role nbacts\n      open : text \"Open in the middle\"\n        role nbbtn\n        on click do read \$hv; do prop \$hv viewing=\$c back=\"\$hv.viewing\" find=\"\"\n# the latest comment only (a clamp would print how many it cut, in the card)\nnote : column\n  role nbnote\n  only when \$index = \$count\n  by : text \"latest, from \$m.by\"\n    role nbnoteby\n  said : text \"\$m.text\"\n    role nbnotetext\n    clamp 3\n# the last five landed (by \$index, not a clamp, which would print what it cut)\ndone : row\n  role nbdone\n  only when \$index > \$count - 5\n  on click do read \$hv; do prop \$hv viewing=\$c back=\"\$hv.viewing\" find=\"\"\n  what : text \"\$((\$c.brief or \$c.title))\"\n    role nbdonetitle\n    clamp 1\n    share 1\n  when : text \"\$(day-or-time(\$changed.commission, \$today))\"\n    role nbwhen\n    only when (\$changed.commission or \"\") != \"\""
read a5682
do rewrite a5682 text="# home-board-small: the board in one line (a5496), for its panel title, the shelf and a narrow room (a6010, round 3):\n# what needs Alex first, then what is moving; a count of nothing is left out, so a quiet day reads short.\nline : row\n  role nbsmall\n  let need = count(tag:ready-for-review,-prop:review=later) + count(prop:design=waiting,-prop:review=later) + count(prop:commission=failed,prop:asked_by=alex,-prop:review=later)\n  let move = count(prop:commission=asked) + count(prop:commission=working) + count(prop:commission=ready) + count(prop:commission=landing)\n  let jeff = count(prop:commission=waiting) + count(prop:commission=failed,prop:asked_by!=alex)\n  you : text \"\$(need) need you\"\n    role nbsmall.need\n    only when need > 0\n  moving : text \"\$(move) moving\"\n    role summary\n    only when move > 0\n  waits : text \"\$(jeff) wait on JEFF\"\n    role nbsmall.jeff\n    only when jeff > 0\n  quiet : text \"all quiet\"\n    role summary\n    only when need + move + jeff = 0"
read a5674
do tag a5674 add=glance-you,glance-board
